          <ui:InvokeCode ContinueOnError="{x:Null}" DisplayName="PDF 뷰어 툴바 다운로드 구조 선택" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="InvokeCode_AnchorPdfDownloadToFullscreen_1" Code="Dim root = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject.Parse(candidateJsonText)&#xA;Dim source = TryCast(root(&quot;candidates&quot;), Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray)&#xA;If source Is Nothing Then Throw New Exception(&quot;PDF candidates 배열이 없습니다.&quot;)&#xA;&#xA;Dim toolbarAnchorIds As New System.Collections.Generic.List(Of Integer)()&#xA;Dim downloadTokens As New System.Collections.Generic.List(Of Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JToken)()&#xA;&#xA;For Each token As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JToken In source&#xA;    Dim elementId As String = System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;element_id&quot;)).Trim()&#xA;    Dim combined As String = (System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;text&quot;)) &amp; &quot; &quot; &amp; System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;name_hint&quot;)) &amp; &quot; &quot; &amp; System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;aria_label&quot;))).Trim().ToLowerInvariant()&#xA;    Dim numberValue As Integer = -1&#xA;    If elementId.Length &gt; 1 Then Integer.TryParse(elementId.Substring(1), numberValue)&#xA;&#xA;    Dim isToolbarAnchor As Boolean = combined.Replace(&quot; &quot;, String.Empty).Contains(&quot;전체화면&quot;) OrElse combined.Contains(&quot;fullscreen&quot;) OrElse combined.Contains(&quot;full screen&quot;) OrElse combined.Contains(&quot;인쇄&quot;) OrElse combined.Contains(&quot;print&quot;) OrElse combined.Contains(&quot;확대&quot;) OrElse combined.Contains(&quot;zoom&quot;)&#xA;    Dim isDownload As Boolean = combined.Contains(&quot;다운로드&quot;) OrElse combined.Contains(&quot;download&quot;)&#xA;&#xA;    If isToolbarAnchor AndAlso numberValue &gt;= 0 Then toolbarAnchorIds.Add(numberValue)&#xA;    If isDownload AndAlso numberValue &gt;= 0 Then downloadTokens.Add(token)&#xA;Next&#xA;&#xA;If downloadTokens.Count = 0 Then Throw New Exception(&quot;PDF 다운로드 후보가 없습니다.&quot;)&#xA;&#xA;Dim selectedToken As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JToken = Nothing&#xA;Dim selectedDistance As Integer = Integer.MaxValue&#xA;For Each downloadToken As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JToken In downloadTokens&#xA;    Dim downloadId As String = System.Convert.ToString(downloadToken(&quot;element_id&quot;)).Trim()&#xA;    Dim downloadNumber As Integer = -1&#xA;    If downloadId.Length &gt; 1 Then Integer.TryParse(downloadId.Substring(1), downloadNumber)&#xA;    For Each anchorNumber As Integer In toolbarAnchorIds&#xA;        Dim distance As Integer = System.Math.Abs(downloadNumber - anchorNumber)&#xA;        If distance &gt; 0 AndAlso distance &lt;= 10 AndAlso distance &lt; selectedDistance Then&#xA;            selectedDistance = distance&#xA;            selectedToken = downloadToken&#xA;        End If&#xA;    Next&#xA;Next&#xA;&#xA;' Chrome 상단 다운로드 버튼은 접근성 트리 앞부분에, PDF 뷰어 내부 툴바는 뒤쪽에 수집됩니다.&#xA;' 앵커 명칭이 누락된 뷰어에서는 가장 뒤쪽 다운로드 후보를 안전 보조 규칙으로 사용합니다.&#xA;If selectedToken Is Nothing Then&#xA;    Dim highestId As Integer = -1&#xA;    For Each downloadToken As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JToken In downloadTokens&#xA;        Dim downloadId As String = System.Convert.ToString(downloadToken(&quot;element_id&quot;)).Trim()&#xA;        Dim downloadNumber As Integer = -1&#xA;        If downloadId.Length &gt; 1 Then Integer.TryParse(downloadId.Substring(1), downloadNumber)&#xA;        If downloadNumber &gt; highestId Then&#xA;            highestId = downloadNumber&#xA;            selectedToken = downloadToken&#xA;        End If&#xA;    Next&#xA;    selectedDistance = -1&#xA;End If&#xA;&#xA;If selectedToken Is Nothing Then Throw New Exception(&quot;PDF 뷰어 내부 다운로드 버튼을 결정하지 못했습니다.&quot;)&#xA;&#xA;Dim anchored As New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray()&#xA;anchored.Add(selectedToken.DeepClone())&#xA;root(&quot;candidates&quot;) = anchored&#xA;root(&quot;candidate_count&quot;) = 1&#xA;root(&quot;selection_rule&quot;) = If(selectedDistance &gt;= 0, &quot;PDF_TOOLBAR_NEIGHBOR_DOWNLOAD&quot;, &quot;PDF_VIEWER_TREE_LAST_DOWNLOAD&quot;)&#xA;root(&quot;anchor_distance&quot;) = selectedDistance&#xA;candidateJsonText = root.ToString(Newtonsoft.Json.Formatting.None)&#xA;candidateCountValue = 1">
            <ui:InvokeCode.Arguments>
              <InOutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="candidateJsonText">[candidateJson]</InOutArgument>
              <InOutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:Int32" x:Key="candidateCountValue">[candidateCount]</InOutArgument>
            </ui:InvokeCode.Arguments>
          </ui:InvokeCode>
          <ui:InvokeCode ContinueOnError="{x:Null}" DisplayName="다운로드 후보 화면 위치 정렬" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="InvokeCode_OrderDownloadByScreenPosition_1" Code="Dim root = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject.Parse(candidateJsonText)&#xA;Dim source = TryCast(root(&quot;candidates&quot;), Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray)&#xA;If source Is Nothing Then Throw New Exception(&quot;PDF candidates 배열이 없습니다.&quot;)&#xA;&#xA;Dim bestToken As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JToken = Nothing&#xA;Dim bestY As Integer = Integer.MinValue&#xA;&#xA;For Each token As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JToken In source&#xA;    Dim elementId As String = System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;element_id&quot;)).Trim()&#xA;    Dim nameHint As String = System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;name_hint&quot;)).Trim().ToLowerInvariant()&#xA;    Dim ariaLabel As String = System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;aria_label&quot;)).Trim().ToLowerInvariant()&#xA;    Dim itemText As String = System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;text&quot;)).Trim().ToLowerInvariant()&#xA;    Dim isDownload As Boolean = nameHint = &quot;다운로드&quot; OrElse nameHint = &quot;download&quot; OrElse ariaLabel = &quot;다운로드&quot; OrElse ariaLabel = &quot;download&quot; OrElse itemText = &quot;다운로드&quot; OrElse itemText = &quot;download&quot;&#xA;    If Not isDownload Then Continue For&#xA;&#xA;    Dim rectText As String = String.Empty&#xA;    If elementMapValue IsNot Nothing AndAlso elementMapValue.ContainsKey(elementId) Then&#xA;        Dim mappedElement As UiPath.Core.UiElement = elementMapValue(elementId)&#xA;        For Each attributeName As String In New String() {&quot;screenrect&quot;, &quot;boundingrectangle&quot;, &quot;position&quot;, &quot;rectangle&quot;}&#xA;            Try&#xA;                Dim rawValue As Object = mappedElement.Get(attributeName)&#xA;                If rawValue IsNot Nothing AndAlso Not String.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(rawValue.ToString()) Then&#xA;                    rectText = rawValue.ToString()&#xA;                    Exit For&#xA;                End If&#xA;            Catch&#xA;            End Try&#xA;        Next&#xA;    End If&#xA;&#xA;    token(&quot;screen_rect_hint&quot;) = rectText&#xA;    Dim matches As System.Text.RegularExpressions.MatchCollection = System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex.Matches(rectText, &quot;-?[0-9]+&quot;)&#xA;    If matches.Count &gt;= 2 Then&#xA;        Dim screenY As Integer = 0&#xA;        If Integer.TryParse(matches(1).Value, screenY) Then&#xA;            token(&quot;screen_y_hint&quot;) = screenY&#xA;            If screenY &gt; bestY Then&#xA;                bestY = screenY&#xA;                bestToken = token&#xA;            End If&#xA;        End If&#xA;    End If&#xA;Next&#xA;&#xA;If bestToken IsNot Nothing Then&#xA;    Dim ordered As New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray()&#xA;    ordered.Add(bestToken.DeepClone())&#xA;    For Each token As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JToken In source&#xA;        If Not Object.ReferenceEquals(token, bestToken) Then ordered.Add(token.DeepClone())&#xA;    Next&#xA;    root(&quot;candidates&quot;) = ordered&#xA;    candidateJsonText = root.ToString(Newtonsoft.Json.Formatting.None)&#xA;End If">
            <ui:InvokeCode.Arguments>
              <InOutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="candidateJsonText">[candidateJson]</InOutArgument>
              <InArgument x:TypeArguments="scg:Dictionary(x:String, ui:UiElement)" x:Key="elementMapValue">[elementMap]</InArgument>
            </ui:InvokeCode.Arguments>
          </ui:InvokeCode>
          <ui:InvokeCode ContinueOnError="{x:Null}" DisplayName="PDF 툴바 다운로드 버튼 우선" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="InvokeCode_PreferPdfToolbarDownload_1" Code="Dim root = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject.Parse(candidateJsonText)&#xA;Dim source = TryCast(root(&quot;candidates&quot;), Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray)&#xA;If source Is Nothing Then Throw New Exception(&quot;PDF candidates 배열이 없습니다.&quot;)&#xA;&#xA;Dim exactDownloads As New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray()&#xA;For Each token As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JToken In source&#xA;    Dim role As String = System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;role&quot;)).Trim().ToLowerInvariant()&#xA;    Dim nameHint As String = System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;name_hint&quot;)).Trim().ToLowerInvariant()&#xA;    Dim ariaLabel As String = System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;aria_label&quot;)).Trim().ToLowerInvariant()&#xA;    Dim itemText As String = System.Convert.ToString(token(&quot;text&quot;)).Trim().ToLowerInvariant()&#xA;    Dim exactName As Boolean = nameHint = &quot;다운로드&quot; OrElse nameHint = &quot;download&quot; OrElse ariaLabel = &quot;다운로드&quot; OrElse ariaLabel = &quot;download&quot; OrElse itemText = &quot;다운로드&quot; OrElse itemText = &quot;download&quot;&#xA;    Dim isButton As Boolean = role = &quot;단추&quot; OrElse role = &quot;button&quot; OrElse role.Contains(&quot;push button&quot;)&#xA;    If exactName AndAlso isButton Then exactDownloads.Add(token.DeepClone())&#xA;Next&#xA;&#xA;' Chrome UI보다 PDF 문서 영역의 툴바 버튼이 접근성 트리에서 먼저 수집됩니다.&#xA;' 동일 이름이 여러 개면 첫 번째만 남겨 주소창 옆 Chrome 다운로드 버튼을 배제합니다.&#xA;If exactDownloads.Count &gt; 0 Then&#xA;    While exactDownloads.Count &gt; 1&#xA;        exactDownloads.RemoveAt(exactDownloads.Count - 1)&#xA;    End While&#xA;    root(&quot;candidates&quot;) = exactDownloads&#xA;    root(&quot;candidate_count&quot;) = exactDownloads.Count&#xA;    candidateJsonText = root.ToString(Newtonsoft.Json.Formatting.None)&#xA;    candidateCountValue = exactDownloads.Count&#xA;End If">
            <ui:InvokeCode.Arguments>
              <InOutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="candidateJsonText">[candidateJson]</InOutArgument>
